#: ../../tools/reactome_analysis_tools.rst:36 34ecd090a3724e8c979a2f1a98ef002c
msgid ""
"``identifiers`` (string) (required) Newline-separated list of "
"gene/protein identifiers. Supports gene symbols (TP53, BRCA1), UniProt "
"IDs (P04637, P38398), or Ensembl IDs. Example: "
"'TP53\\\\nBRCA1\\\\nCDH1\\\\nEGFR\\\\nKRAS'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/reactome_analysis_tools.rst:39
